        "controlledJoints": "Keep your wrists steady and your back upright.",
        "supportAndPosture": "Stand side-on with parallel feet about hip-width apart and knees slightly bent.",
        "disqualifyingCompensations": [
          "Turning toward the pulley changes the trunk action.",
          "Leaning or stepping to move the handle changes the fixture."
        ],
        "sideOrDirection": "Complete the prescribed repetitions with the cable on each side. One press and return is one repetition. Record the selected stack load; pulley ratios differ between machines.",
